"Define attributes for memory region or reset memory region handling to\n"
"target-based.\n"
"Usage: mem auto\n"
"       mem <lo addr> <hi addr> [<mode> <width> <cache>],\n"
"where <mode>  may be rw (read/write), ro (read-only) or wo (write-only),\n"
"      <width> may be 8, 16, 32, or 64, and\n"
"      <cache> may be cache or nocache"
msgstr ""
"Definiera attribut för minnesregion eller återställ hanteringen av minnesregion till\n"
"målbaserad.\n"
"Användning: mem auto\n"
"       mem <lo addr> <hi addr> [<mode> <width> <cache>],\n"
"där <mode> kan vara rw (läs/skriv), ro (endast läs) eller wo (endast skriv),\n"
